        <http://w3id.org/cacao/shapes/CACAO_0000018>,
        <http://w3id.org/cacao/shapes/CACAO_0000035>,
        <http://w3id.org/cacao/shapes/P129i_is_subject_of>,
        <http://w3id.org/cacao/shapes/P136i_supported_type_creation>,
