- ‘recognizable’ (E90) is composed of ‘ecognizabl’ (E90).

In First Order Logic:
- P106(x,y) ⇒ E90(x)
- P106(x,y) ⇒ E90(y)
- [P106(x,y) ∧ P106(y,z)] ⇒ P106(x,z)
- P106(x,y) ⇒ ¬P106(y,x)
"""@en ;
    sh:name "P106 ist zusammengesetzt aus"@de,
        "P106 αποτελείται από"@el,
        "P106 is composed of"@en,
