- P108(x,y) ⇒ E24(y)
- P108(x,y) ⇒ P31(x,y)
- P108(x,y) ⇒ P92(x,y)
"""@en ;
    sh:name "P108i wurde hergestellt durch"@de,
        "P108i παρήχθη από"@el,
        "P108i was produced by"@en,
        "P108i a été produit par"@fr,
        "P108i foi produzido por"@pt,
        "P108i был произвeдeн"@ru,
        "P108i 被产生"@zh ;
    sh:nodeKind sh:BlankNodeOrIRI ;
    sh:path <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P108i_was_produced_by> .

<http://w3id.org/cacao/shapes/P109i_is_current_or_former_curator_of> a sh:PropertyShape ;
