        "P112 diminuiu"@pt,
        "P112 умeньшил"@ru,
        "P112 减少了"@zh ;
    sh:class <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E18_Physical_Thing> ;
    sh:description """Quantification: many to many, necessary (1,n:0,n)

