        "P113 αφαίρεσε"@el,
        "P113 removed"@en,
        """Quantification: many to many, necessary (1,n:0,n)

Scope note:
This property identifies the instance of E18 Physical Thing that is removed during an instance of E80 Part Removal activity.

Examples:
- The opening of the coffin of Tut-Ankh-Amun (E80) removed The mummy of Tut-Ankh-Amun (E20, E22). (Carter, 2014)

In First Order Logic:
- P113(x,y) ⇒ E80(x)
- P113(x,y) ⇒ E18(y) 
- P113(x,y) ⇒ P12(x,y)
"""@en,
        "P113 a retiré"@fr,
        "P113 removeu"@pt,
        "P113 удалил"@ru,
        "P113 去除了"@zh ;
    sh:class <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E18_Physical_Thing> ;
    sh:description """Quantification: many to many, necessary (1,n:0,n)

Scope note:
This property identifies the instance of E18 Physical Thing that is removed during an instance of E80 Part Removal activity.

Examples:
- The opening of the coffin of Tut-Ankh-Amun (E80) removed The mummy of Tut-Ankh-Amun (E20, E22). (Carter, 2014)

In First Order Logic:
- P113(x,y) ⇒ E80(x)
- P113(x,y) ⇒ E18(y) 
- P113(x,y) ⇒ P12(x,y)
"""@en ;
    sh:name "P113 entfernte"@de,
        "P113 αφαίρεσε"@el,
        "P113 removed"@en,
        "P113 a retiré"@fr,
        "P113 removeu"@pt,
        "P113 удалил"@ru,
        "P113 去除了"@zh ;
    sh:nodeKind sh:BlankNodeOrIRI ;
    sh:path <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P113_removed> .

